Use [yaml-and-schema](../../.agents/skills/yaml-and-schema/SKILL.md) for the actual consumer, then only its prototype/map/resource/build route. [Prototype conventions](../../.agents/rules/yaml-prototype-conventions.md) apply to prototypes, not every workflow/config file. [Marker syntax](../../.agents/rules/arcane-edit-markers.md) and [trajectory](../../.agents/rules/fork-trajectory-priority.md) own inherited placement. In review assess changed schema/references and evidence; do not launch generic builds for YAML syntax alone.
